{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/issues/3345","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/issues/3345/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/issues/3345/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/issues/3345/events","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass/pull/3345","id":4724247745,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBrVDM87pj-QJ","number":3345,"title":"Fix SM120 blockscaled FP32 epilogue store layout","user":{"login":"NVIDIA-JerryChen","id":109948172,"node_id":"U_kgDOBo2tDA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109948172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NVIDIA-JerryChen","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA-JerryChen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NVIDIA-JerryChen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NVIDIA-JerryChen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NVIDIA-JerryChen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NVIDIA-JerryChen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NVIDIA-JerryChen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NVIDIA-JerryChen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NVIDIA-JerryChen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NVIDIA-JerryChen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NVIDIA-JerryChen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3687994693,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBrVDM87b0lVF","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/labels/inactive-30d","name":"inactive-30d","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-23T09:00:22Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T09:52:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/pulls/3345","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass/pull/3345","diff_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass/pull/3345.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass/pull/3345.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Both kernels used `StMatrix8x8x16bOp(..., 2)` to build the C atom passed to `make_tiled_copy_C_atom`. For `Float32` outputs, the actual register-to-SMEM copy atom is `CopyUniversalOp`, but the C TV layout is still derived from this stmatrix C atom. The x2 layout does not cover the full C fragment for this epilogue path, causing incomplete SMEM writes before the final TMA  store. Changing the C atom to `StMatrix8x8x16bOp(..., 4)` provides a C TV layout that covers the full C fragment and fixes the observed FP32 output mismatch.  In fact, unless there is a special case, we do not use x2; by default, we always use x4. Therefore, I think x2 came from a typo.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/issues/3345/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/cutlass/issues/3345/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}